            Penofin Blue Label is the redwood finish to start with, and Ready Seal 520 Redwood is the easiest to apply well. TWP 1500 and Sikkens Cetol SRD give more protection in harsh sun, Cabot Australian Timber Oil gives the richest color, DEFY Extreme is the water-based choice, and Olympic Maximum is the convenient big-box option.
